msgstr "估計統合分析模型"

msgid "Full dataset"
msgstr "完整資料集"

msgid "Estimating Subgroup Models"
msgstr "估計子群模型"

msgid ""
"The loaded distance matrix for '%1$s' does not match the dataset. The "
"following levels are missing: %2$s."
msgstr "『%1$s』的已載入距離矩陣與資料集不符。缺少以下水準：%2$s。"

msgid ""
"The loaded correlation matrix for '%1$s' does not match the dataset. The "
"following levels are missing: %2$s."
msgstr "『%1$s』的已載入相關矩陣與資料集不符。缺少以下水準：%2$s。"

msgid "All observations were removed as influential."
msgstr "所有觀察值皆因具影響力而被移除。"

msgid "Intercept"
msgstr "截距"

msgid "%1$s: not available"
msgstr "%1$s：不可用"

msgid "Residual heterogeneity"
msgstr "殘差異質性"

msgid "Moderation (effect size): %1$s"
msgstr "調節作用（效果量）：%1$s"

msgid "Moderation (heterogeneity): %1$s"
msgstr "調節作用（異質性）：%1$s"

msgid "Moderation: %1$s"
msgstr "調節作用：%1$s"

msgid "%s%% CI"
msgstr "%s%% 可信區間（CI）"

msgid "%s%% PI"
msgstr "%s%% 預測區間"

msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "子群"

msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "警告："

msgid ""
"Cluster-robust inference has very low effective degrees of freedom. When "
"Satterthwaite df < 4, p-values should be interpreted with extreme caution."
msgstr ""
"叢集穩健推論的有效自由度非常低。當 Satterthwaite 自由度 < 4 時，p 值應極其謹"
"慎地解釋。"

msgid ""
"Knapp-Hartung inference is based on very few residual degrees of freedom; "
"results can be sensitive and should be interpreted cautiously."
msgstr "Knapp-Hartung 推論基於極少的殘差自由度；結果可能敏感，應謹慎解釋。"

msgid ""
"The model estimation failed with the following message: %1$s. Please, "
"consider simplifying the model."
msgstr "模型估計因以下訊息而失敗：%1$s。請考慮簡化模型。"

msgid ""
"The cluster-robust standard errors could not be computed. Please, consider "
"modifying the clustering settings in the 'Advanced' section."
msgstr "無法計算叢集穩健標準誤。請考慮修改『進階』區段中的叢集設定。"

msgid "Fewer than two estimates."
msgstr "估計值少於兩個。"

msgid ""
"The selected 'Method' requires specification of the 'Weights' option in the "
"'Advanced' section."
msgstr "所選的『方法』需要在『進階』區段中指定『權重』選項。"

msgid ""
"The GLMM could not be estimated for the selected model. This can happen with "
"sparse event counts, risk differences, random study effects, or a moderator "
"structure that is too complex for the data. Try simplifying the moderator "
"model, using the fixed study-effects GLMM, changing the effect-size measure "
"if appropriate, or centering/scaling continuous moderators.\n"
"\n"
"Metafor reported: Cannot fit ML model."
msgstr ""
"無法對所選模型估計 GLMM。這可能發生在事件計數稀疏、風險差異、隨機研究效果，或"
"調節變項結構對資料而言過於複雜時。請嘗試簡化調節變項模型、使用固定研究效果 "
"GLMM、在適當的情況下變更效果量測量，或對連續調節變項進行置中／縮放。\n"
"\n"
"Metafor 報告：無法適配 ML 模型。"

